<view class="page-shell poster-page"><view class="eyebrow">星座卡牌 · POSTCARD</view><view class="title">{{card.type === 'pair' ? '留住你们的星光' : card.type === 'dice' ? '留住这次小幸运' : card.type === 'spread' ? '留住这组星光' : card.type === 'book' ? '留住这一页' : '留住这张卡'}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="status"><view class="status-mark">✦</view><view>正在为你排版…</view></view><image wx:if="{{src}}" class="poster-image" src="{{src}}" mode="widthFix" bindtap="preview" show-menu-by-longpress /><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="status"><view>暂时没能生成海报</view><button wx:if="{{card}}" class="ghost-button poster-action" style="width:100%;margin-top:24rpx" bindtap="generate">重新生成</button></view><block wx:if="{{src}}"><button class="primary-button poster-action" style="width:100%;margin-top:24rpx" bindtap="preview">查看大图 · 长按保存或分享</button><button wx:if="{{card.type === 'pair' || card.type === 'dice'}}" class="ghost-button poster-action" style="width:100%;margin-top:24rpx" bindtap="sharePreview">预览与分享小程序结果</button><button wx:else class="ghost-button poster-action" style="width:100%;margin-top:24rpx" open-type="share">同时分享这张卡的小程序</button><view class="note">海报是一张图片。发送小程序卡片后，朋友可以直接进入同一结果，也能体验自己的卡片。</view></block><canvas type="2d" id="posterCanvas" class="poster-canvas"></canvas></view>
